# ── Client data must never reach the repo ────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub Pages serves every file in the branch, so anything committed here is
# readable at a URL whether or not the repo itself is private.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
_test.*

# ── Internal notes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These carry real pricing and at least one real client name in their worked
# examples. They are the team's working notes, not part of the app, and Pages
# would publish them at /SETUP.md and friends.
SETUP.md
SHAREPOINT-BUILD.md
CHANGELOG.md
DEMO.md
ENTRA-REQUEST.md

# ── Build and dev tooling, not runtime ───────────────────────────────────────
# The app is one file with no build step; these produce or serve it locally.
*.ps1

# ── Source art ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~2MB each. The sidebar ships as sampled gradient stops inside index.html.
Light Portrait.png
Dark Portrait.png
